# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.18 on the `json` wire: the source of the
# entities the `conformance-cond-*` packs are encoded from, where a same-format
# round trip cannot give them (an entity that holds a key the target does not
# map, such as the companion key of a `with` line). Public. No kinds. One
# member per key, no `with`; items of three lists hold two or four keys.
format  conformance-cond-src
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   probe.x   x   int
field   probe.y   y   int
field   probe.z   z   int
field   probe.w   w   int
field   probe.c1  c1  int
field   probe.c2  c2  int
field   probe.n   n   int
field   probe.qty qty int
field   probe.s1  s1  string
field   probe.s2  s2  string
field   callsign  cs  string
group   probe.items  items
  field probe.label  label  string
  field probe.qty    qty    int
  field probe.val    val    int
  field probe.x      x      int
end
group   probe.nums  nums
  field probe.val  v  int
  field probe.tag  t  string
end
group   probe.names  names
  field probe.tag  t  string
  field probe.val  v  int
end
